l73: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ v1_tl_lz → v1_d_nat x t $ by v1_skip_lz [l2, l72]
l74: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ v1_tl_s → v1_d_nat x t $ by v1_take_s [l32, l73]
l75: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ lsig → v1_d_nat x t $ by v1_take_nz [l29, l74]
