l50: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ v1_tl_ind_rec → v1_d_ind u v x y t $ by v1_skip_ind_rec [l8, l49]
l51: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ v1_tl_ind_ctor → v1_d_ind u v x y t $ by v1_skip_ind_ctor [l8, l50]
l52: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ v1_tl_ind_ty → v1_d_ind u v x y t $ by v1_skip_ind_ty [l8, l51]
l53: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ v1_tl_ind_mkn → v1_d_ind u v x y t $ by v1_take_ind_mkn [l36, l52]
l54: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ v1_tl_ccons → v1_d_ind u v x y t $ by v1_skip_ccons [l20, l53]
