l57: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ v1_tl_tnil → v1_d_ind u v x y t $ by v1_skip_tnil [l18, l56]
l58: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ v1_tl_ind_mk → v1_d_ind u v x y t $ by v1_take_ind_mk [l33, l57]
l59: $ G ⇒ ⟨ c , ⟨ k , a ⟩ ⟩ ∈ v1_tl_lit → v1_d_ind u v x y t $ by v1_skip_lit [l8, l58]
