l15: $ G , ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lsubst y z v w) (scons (ra_lsubst y u v a) ∅) , ra_lsubst y ⟨ kc_lmax , scons z (scons u ∅) ⟩ v ⟨ kc_lmax , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_lsubst (suc kr_lsubst) $ by ex_elim [l14, l13]
