l2: $ G , x ∊ cl_lsubst_lt ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u (x = ⟨ scons (ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons z ∅ ⟩ y) ∅ , ra_lsubst y ⟨ kc_lparam , scons z ∅ ⟩ u ⟨ kc_lparam , scons z ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
