----
l1: $ G , x ∊ cl_closed_app ⇒ x ∊ cl_closed_app $ by ax
l2: $ G , x ∊ cl_closed_app ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u (x = ⟨ scons (ra_closed y z) (scons (ra_closed y u) ∅) , ra_closed y ⟨ kc_app , scons z (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_closed y z) (scons (ra_closed y u) ∅) , ra_closed y ⟨ kc_app , scons z (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ scons (ra_closed y z) (scons (ra_closed y u) ∅) , ra_closed y ⟨ kc_app , scons z (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
