l4: $ G , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_closed y ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons z (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ kr_closed ∈ ω $ by x1_kr_closed
l5: $ G , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_closed y ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons z (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_closed (suc kr_closed) $ by y1_lab_self [l3, l4]
l6: $ G , ∃ u (x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_closed y ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons z (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ u (x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_closed y ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons z (scons u ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
