l2: $ G , x ∊ cl_closed_proj ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_closed y v) ∅ , ra_closed y ⟨ kc_proj , scons z (scons u (scons v ∅)) ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_closed y v) ∅ , ra_closed y ⟨ kc_proj , scons z (scons u (scons v ∅)) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ scons (ra_closed y v) ∅ , ra_closed y ⟨ kc_proj , scons z (scons u (scons v ∅)) ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
