l5: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_le z u) (scons (ra_add u y v) ∅) , ra_lift y z ⟨ kc_bvar , scons u ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_bvar , scons v ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_lift (suc kr_lift) $ by y1_lab_self [l3, l4]
l6: $ G , ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_le z u) (scons (ra_add u y v) ∅) , ra_lift y z ⟨ kc_bvar , scons u ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_bvar , scons v ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_le z u) (scons (ra_add u y v) ∅) , ra_lift y z ⟨ kc_bvar , scons u ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_bvar , scons v ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
