l9: $ G , ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lift y z u w) (scons (ra_lift y z v a) ∅) , ra_lift y z ⟨ kc_app , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_lift (suc kr_lift) $ by ex_elim [l8, l7]
l10: $ G , ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lift y z u w) (scons (ra_lift y z v a) ∅) , ra_lift y z ⟨ kc_app , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lift y z u w) (scons (ra_lift y z v a) ∅) , ra_lift y z ⟨ kc_app , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
l11: $ G , ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lift y z u w) (scons (ra_lift y z v a) ∅) , ra_lift y z ⟨ kc_app , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_lift (suc kr_lift) $ by ex_elim [l10, l9]
