----
l1: $ G , x ∊ cl_lift_lam ⇒ x ∊ cl_lift_lam $ by ax
l2: $ G , x ∊ cl_lift_lam ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lift y z u w) (scons (ra_lift y ⟨ kc_s , scons z ∅ ⟩ v a) ∅) , ra_lift y z ⟨ kc_lam , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
