l14: $ G , ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lift y z w a) ∅ , ra_lift y z ⟨ kc_proj , scons u (scons v (scons w ∅)) ⟩ ⟨ kc_proj , scons u (scons v (scons a ∅)) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lift y z w a) ∅ , ra_lift y z ⟨ kc_proj , scons u (scons v (scons w ∅)) ⟩ ⟨ kc_proj , scons u (scons v (scons a ∅)) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
l15: $ G , ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lift y z w a) ∅ , ra_lift y z ⟨ kc_proj , scons u (scons v (scons w ∅)) ⟩ ⟨ kc_proj , scons u (scons v (scons a ∅)) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_lift (suc kr_lift) $ by ex_elim [l14, l13]
