l5: $ G , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_nth_pi ⟨ kc_pi , scons y (scons z ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ y ⟩ ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_nth_pi (suc kr_nth_pi) $ by y1_lab_self [l3, l4]
