l7: $ G , ∃ z (x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_nth_pi ⟨ kc_pi , scons y (scons z ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ y ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_nth_pi (suc kr_nth_pi) $ by ex_elim [l6, l5]
