l7: $ G , ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lams v ⟨ kc_lam , scons y (scons z ∅) ⟩ u) ∅ , ra_lams ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons v ∅) ⟩ z u ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_lams (suc kr_lams) $ by ex_elim [l6, l5]
l8: $ G , ∃ u ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lams v ⟨ kc_lam , scons y (scons z ∅) ⟩ u) ∅ , ra_lams ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons v ∅) ⟩ z u ⟩) ⇒ ∃ u ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lams v ⟨ kc_lam , scons y (scons z ∅) ⟩ u) ∅ , ra_lams ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons v ∅) ⟩ z u ⟩) $ by ax
l9: $ G , ∃ u ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lams v ⟨ kc_lam , scons y (scons z ∅) ⟩ u) ∅ , ra_lams ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons v ∅) ⟩ z u ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_lams (suc kr_lams) $ by ex_elim [l8, l7]
l10: $ G , ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lams v ⟨ kc_lam , scons y (scons z ∅) ⟩ u) ∅ , ra_lams ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons v ∅) ⟩ z u ⟩) ⇒ ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lams v ⟨ kc_lam , scons y (scons z ∅) ⟩ u) ∅ , ra_lams ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons v ∅) ⟩ z u ⟩) $ by ax
l11: $ G , ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v (x = ⟨ scons (ra_lams v ⟨ kc_lam , scons y (scons z ∅) ⟩ u) ∅ , ra_lams ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons v ∅) ⟩ z u ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_lams (suc kr_lams) $ by ex_elim [l10, l9]
