l2: $ G , x ∊ cl_iargs_s ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w (x = ⟨ scons (ra_iargs y z u v) (scons (ra_closed y w) ∅) , ra_iargs y ⟨ kc_s , scons z ∅ ⟩ u ⟨ kc_app , scons v (scons w ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
