l4: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_iargs y z u v) (scons (ra_closed y w) ∅) , ra_iargs y ⟨ kc_s , scons z ∅ ⟩ u ⟨ kc_app , scons v (scons w ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ kr_iargs ∈ ω $ by x1_kr_iargs
