l10: $ G , ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u w) (scons (ra_rst y z v a) ∅) , ra_rst y z ⟨ kc_pi , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u w) (scons (ra_rst y z v a) ∅) , ra_rst y z ⟨ kc_pi , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
l11: $ G , ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u w) (scons (ra_rst y z v a) ∅) , ra_rst y z ⟨ kc_pi , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_rst (suc kr_rst) $ by ex_elim [l10, l9]
l12: $ G , ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u w) (scons (ra_rst y z v a) ∅) , ra_rst y z ⟨ kc_pi , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u w) (scons (ra_rst y z v a) ∅) , ra_rst y z ⟨ kc_pi , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
l13: $ G , ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u w) (scons (ra_rst y z v a) ∅) , ra_rst y z ⟨ kc_pi , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_rst (suc kr_rst) $ by ex_elim [l12, l11]
l14: $ G , ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u w) (scons (ra_rst y z v a) ∅) , ra_rst y z ⟨ kc_pi , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u w) (scons (ra_rst y z v a) ∅) , ra_rst y z ⟨ kc_pi , scons u (scons v ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons w (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
