l2: $ G , x ∊ cl_nst_hit_s ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b (x = ⟨ scons (ra_nst_hit v ⟨ kc_s , scons w ∅ ⟩ a b z u) ∅ , ra_nst_hit ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons v ∅) ⟩ w a b z u ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_nst_hit v ⟨ kc_s , scons w ∅ ⟩ a b z u) ∅ , ra_nst_hit ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons v ∅) ⟩ w a b z u ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ scons (ra_nst_hit v ⟨ kc_s , scons w ∅ ⟩ a b z u) ∅ , ra_nst_hit ⟨ kc_cons , scons y (scons v ∅) ⟩ w a b z u ⟩ $ by ax
