l7: $ G , ∃ b (x = ⟨ scons (ra_spz y z u v a) (scons (ra_spz y z u w b) ∅) , ra_spz y z u ⟨ kc_app , scons v (scons w ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_spz (suc kr_spz) $ by ex_elim [l6, l5]
