l14: $ G , ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b (x = ⟨ scons (ra_spz y z u v a) (scons (ra_spz y z ⟨ kc_s , scons u ∅ ⟩ w b) ∅) , ra_spz y z u ⟨ kc_pi , scons v (scons w ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b (x = ⟨ scons (ra_spz y z u v a) (scons (ra_spz y z ⟨ kc_s , scons u ∅ ⟩ w b) ∅) , ra_spz y z u ⟨ kc_pi , scons v (scons w ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
