l9: $ G , ∃ z ∃ u (x = ⟨ scons (ra_afree u) ∅ , ra_afree ⟨ kc_proj , scons y (scons z (scons u ∅)) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_afree (suc kr_afree) $ by ex_elim [l8, l7]
