l51: $ G , ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f ∃ g ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ d ∃ e ∃ h ∃ l ∃ m ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ r ∃ t (x = ⟨ scons (ra_add c z g) (scons (ra_recfield y u z c m j) (scons (ra_sinst y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ u g m n) (scons (ra_add v u i) (scons (ra_lift i c n o) (scons (ra_add f b k) (scons (ra_add d c k) (scons (ra_add e ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ d) (scons (ra_add k v h) (scons (ra_lift d ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ o p) (scons (ra_ihty y z u h e ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ j p r) (scons (ra_mwalk y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons f ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_cons , scons r (scons l ∅) ⟩ q t) ∅))))))))))) , ra_mwalk y z u v w a b c f l ⟨ kc_pi , scons m (scons q ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons o (scons t ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_mwalk (suc kr_mwalk) $ by ex_elim [l50, l49]
