l1: $ G , x ∊ cl_cminors_cons ⇒ x ∊ cl_cminors_cons $ by ax
l2: $ G , x ∊ cl_cminors_cons ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f ∃ g ∃ i ∃ j (x = ⟨ scons (ra_npis c b) (scons (ra_mwalk y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ c f) (scons (ra_cminors y z u ⟨ kc_s , scons v ∅ ⟩ w ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ g i) (scons (ra_capp i ⟨ kc_cons , scons f (scons ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ j) ∅))) , ra_cminors y z u v w a ⟨ kc_ccons , scons c (scons g ∅) ⟩ j ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_npis c b) (scons (ra_mwalk y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ c f) (scons (ra_cminors y z u ⟨ kc_s , scons v ∅ ⟩ w ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ g i) (scons (ra_capp i ⟨ kc_cons , scons f (scons ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ j) ∅))) , ra_cminors y z u v w a ⟨ kc_ccons , scons c (scons g ∅) ⟩ j ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ scons (ra_npis c b) (scons (ra_mwalk y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ c f) (scons (ra_cminors y z u ⟨ kc_s , scons v ∅ ⟩ w ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ g i) (scons (ra_capp i ⟨ kc_cons , scons f (scons ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ j) ∅))) , ra_cminors y z u v w a ⟨ kc_ccons , scons c (scons g ∅) ⟩ j ⟩ $ by ax
