l5: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_npis c b) (scons (ra_mwalk y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ c f) (scons (ra_cminors y z u ⟨ kc_s , scons v ∅ ⟩ w ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ g i) (scons (ra_capp i ⟨ kc_cons , scons f (scons ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ j) ∅))) , ra_cminors y z u v w a ⟨ kc_ccons , scons c (scons g ∅) ⟩ j ⟩ ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_cminors (suc kr_cminors) $ by y1_lab_self [l3, l4]
