l18: $ G , ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rtail y z u v w ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ c f) ∅ , ra_rtail y z u v w a ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons c ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons f ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rtail y z u v w ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ c f) ∅ , ra_rtail y z u v w a ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons c ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons f ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
l19: $ G , ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rtail y z u v w ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ c f) ∅ , ra_rtail y z u v w a ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons c ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons f ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_rtail (suc kr_rtail) $ by ex_elim [l18, l17]
l20: $ G , ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rtail y z u v w ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ c f) ∅ , ra_rtail y z u v w a ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons c ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons f ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rtail y z u v w ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ c f) ∅ , ra_rtail y z u v w a ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons c ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons f ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
