lemma y1_k_ihval_lam (G: hyps): $ G ⇒ cl_ihval_lam ⊆ y1_lab kr_ihval (suc kr_ihval) $
----
l1: $ G , x ∊ cl_ihval_lam ⇒ x ∊ cl_ihval_lam $ by ax
l2: $ G , x ∊ cl_ihval_lam ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f ∃ g ∃ i ∃ j (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ f i j) ∅ , ra_ihval y z u v w a b c f ⟨ kc_pi , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons g (scons j ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ f i j) ∅ , ra_ihval y z u v w a b c f ⟨ kc_pi , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons g (scons j ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ f i j) ∅ , ra_ihval y z u v w a b c f ⟨ kc_pi , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons g (scons j ∅) ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
l4: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ f i j) ∅ , ra_ihval y z u v w a b c f ⟨ kc_pi , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons g (scons j ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ kr_ihval ∈ ω $ by x1_kr_ihval
l5: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ f i j) ∅ , ra_ihval y z u v w a b c f ⟨ kc_pi , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons g (scons j ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_ihval (suc kr_ihval) $ by y1_lab_self [l3, l4]
l6: $ G , ∃ j (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ f i j) ∅ , ra_ihval y z u v w a b c f ⟨ kc_pi , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons g (scons j ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ j (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ f i j) ∅ , ra_ihval y z u v w a b c f ⟨ kc_pi , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons g (scons j ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
l7: $ G , ∃ j (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ f i j) ∅ , ra_ihval y z u v w a b c f ⟨ kc_pi , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons g (scons j ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_ihval (suc kr_ihval) $ by ex_elim [l6, l5]
l8: $ G , ∃ i ∃ j (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ f i j) ∅ , ra_ihval y z u v w a b c f ⟨ kc_pi , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons g (scons j ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ i ∃ j (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ f i j) ∅ , ra_ihval y z u v w a b c f ⟨ kc_pi , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons g (scons j ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
