l12: $ G , ∃ f ∃ g ∃ i ∃ j (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ f i j) ∅ , ra_ihval y z u v w a b c f ⟨ kc_pi , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons g (scons j ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ f ∃ g ∃ i ∃ j (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ f i j) ∅ , ra_ihval y z u v w a b c f ⟨ kc_pi , scons g (scons i ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons g (scons j ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
