l41: $ G , ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f ∃ g ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ d ∃ e ∃ h ∃ l ∃ m ∃ n ∃ o (x = ⟨ scons (ra_add b z c) (scons (ra_recfield y u z b d g) (scons (ra_sinst y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ u c d e) (scons (ra_add v u f) (scons (ra_lift f b e h) (scons (ra_add i b a) (scons (ra_add j ⟨ kc_s , scons ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ i) (scons (ra_lift i ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ h l) (scons (ra_ihval y z u v w a j ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ g l n) (scons (ra_rwalk y z u v w a ⟨ kc_s , scons b ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons k (scons n ∅) ⟩ m o) ∅))))))))) , ra_rwalk y z u v w a b k ⟨ kc_pi , scons d (scons m ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons h (scons o ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_rwalk (suc kr_rwalk) $ by ex_elim [l40, l39]
