l2: $ G , x ∊ cl_field_ty_i ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f ∃ g ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ d (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ind_data y z u v) (scons (ra_nth_ty v w g d) (scons (ra_nth_ctor d ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ i) (scons (ra_clen u b) (scons (ra_ntys v c f) (scons (ra_sinst y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ c b i j) (scons (ra_nth_pi j a k) ∅)))))) , ra_field_ty y w a k ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_ind_data y z u v) (scons (ra_nth_ty v w g d) (scons (ra_nth_ctor d ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ i) (scons (ra_clen u b) (scons (ra_ntys v c f) (scons (ra_sinst y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ c b i j) (scons (ra_nth_pi j a k) ∅)))))) , ra_field_ty y w a k ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ scons (ra_ind_data y z u v) (scons (ra_nth_ty v w g d) (scons (ra_nth_ctor d ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ i) (scons (ra_clen u b) (scons (ra_ntys v c f) (scons (ra_sinst y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ c b i j) (scons (ra_nth_pi j a k) ∅)))))) , ra_field_ty y w a k ⟩ $ by ax
