l4: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u v) (scons (ra_crst y z w a) ∅) , ra_crst y z ⟨ kc_cons , scons u (scons w ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_cons , scons v (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ kr_crst ∈ ω $ by x1_kr_crst
l5: $ G , x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u v) (scons (ra_crst y z w a) ∅) , ra_crst y z ⟨ kc_cons , scons u (scons w ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_cons , scons v (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_crst (suc kr_crst) $ by y1_lab_self [l3, l4]
l6: $ G , ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u v) (scons (ra_crst y z w a) ∅) , ra_crst y z ⟨ kc_cons , scons u (scons w ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_cons , scons v (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u v) (scons (ra_crst y z w a) ∅) , ra_crst y z ⟨ kc_cons , scons u (scons w ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_cons , scons v (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
l7: $ G , ∃ a (x = ⟨ scons (ra_rst y z u v) (scons (ra_crst y z w a) ∅) , ra_crst y z ⟨ kc_cons , scons u (scons w ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_cons , scons v (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ x ∊ y1_lab kr_crst (suc kr_crst) $ by ex_elim [l6, l5]
