l15: $ G , ⟨ pp , ra_inst t1 t2 t3 t4 ⟩ ∈ cl_inst_closed ∪ cl_inst_proj ⇒ ∃ j_v ∃ k_v ∃ e_v ∃ a_v (t1 = k_v ∧ t2 = e_v ∧ t3 = a_v ∧ t4 = e_v ∧ ra_closed j_v e_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le j_v k_v ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ k_v ∃ b_v ∃ i_v ∃ e_v ∃ a_v ∃ e2 (t1 = k_v ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_proj , scons b_v (scons i_v (scons e_v ∅)) ⟩ ∧ t3 = a_v ∧ t4 = ⟨ kc_proj , scons b_v (scons i_v (scons e2 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ ra_inst k_v e_v a_v e2 ∈ lrel) $ by or_elim [l6, l10, l14]
