l4: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_bpow t1 t2 t3 ⟩ , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_bpow y ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_bpow t1 t2 t3 ⟩ = x $ by eq_sym [l3]
