l6: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_bpow t1 t2 t3 ⟩ , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_bpow y ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_bpow t1 t2 t3 ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ , ra_bpow y ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [l4, l5]
l7: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_bpow t1 t2 t3 ⟩ , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_bpow y ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ crn pp ⊆ lrel $ by weaken [#2]
l8: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_bpow t1 t2 t3 ⟩ , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_bpow y ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ a_v (t1 = a_v ∧ t2 = ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = ⟨ kc_bd1 , scons ⟨ kc_b0 , ∅ ⟩ ∅ ⟩) $ by y1_e_bpow_0 [l6, l7]
