l9: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_ind_data t1 t2 t3 t4 ⟩ , ∃ u (x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_ind_data ⟨ kc_ind_mk , scons y (scons z (scons u ∅)) ⟩ y z u ⟩) ⇒ ∃ u (x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_ind_data ⟨ kc_ind_mk , scons y (scons z (scons u ∅)) ⟩ y z u ⟩) $ by ax
