l21: $ G , ⟨ pp , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ⟩ ∈ cl_ipos_closed ∪ (cl_ipos_pi ∪ cl_ipos_app) , ⟨ pp , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ⟩ ∈ cl_ipos_closed ⇒ ∃ D ∃ n_v ∃ np ∃ d_v ∃ k_v ∃ A (t1 = D ∧ t2 = n_v ∧ t3 = np ∧ t4 = d_v ∧ t5 = A ∧ ra_add d_v np k_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed k_v A ∈ lrel) $ by y1_d_ipos_closed [l19, l20]
l22: $ G , ⟨ pp , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ⟩ ∈ cl_ipos_closed ∪ (cl_ipos_pi ∪ cl_ipos_app) , ⟨ pp , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ⟩ ∈ cl_ipos_closed ⇒ ∃ D ∃ n_v ∃ np ∃ d_v ∃ k_v ∃ A (t1 = D ∧ t2 = n_v ∧ t3 = np ∧ t4 = d_v ∧ t5 = A ∧ ra_add d_v np k_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed k_v A ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ D ∃ n_v ∃ np ∃ d_v ∃ k_v ∃ A ∃ B (t1 = D ∧ t2 = n_v ∧ t3 = np ∧ t4 = d_v ∧ t5 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add d_v np k_v ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed k_v A ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos D n_v np ⟨ kc_s , scons d_v ∅ ⟩ B ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ D ∃ n_v ∃ np ∃ d_v ∃ j_v ∃ A (t1 = D ∧ t2 = n_v ∧ t3 = np ∧ t4 = d_v ∧ t5 = A ∧ ra_indapp D n_v np d_v A j_v ∈ lrel) $ by or_intro_l [l21]
