l67: $ G ⇒ ra_rehead V10 V13 V8 V9 V14 ∈ lrel $ by crn_scons_head [l66, l65]
l68: $ G ⇒ ra_pinst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ V10 V12 V13 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rehead V10 V13 V8 V9 V14 ∈ lrel $ by and_intro [l64, l67]
