l6: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_afree t1 ⟩ , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_afree ⟨ kc_quot_mk , scons y ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_afree t1 ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ , ra_afree ⟨ kc_quot_mk , scons y ∅ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [l4, l5]
