l7: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_spz_ctors t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 ⟩ , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_spz_ctors y z u v w a ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ crn pp ⊆ lrel $ by weaken [#2]
l8: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_spz_ctors t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 ⟩ , x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_spz_ctors y z u v w a ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ D ∃ N ∃ I ∃ X ∃ ni ∃ npi (t1 = D ∧ t2 = N ∧ t3 = I ∧ t4 = X ∧ t5 = ni ∧ t6 = npi ∧ t7 = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t8 = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩) $ by y1_e_spz_ctors_nil [l6, l7]
