l13: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_spz_ctors t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 ⟩ , ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_spz_ctors y z u v w a ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_spz_ctors y z u v w a ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
l14: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_spz_ctors t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 ⟩ , ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_spz_ctors y z u v w a ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ D ∃ N ∃ I ∃ X ∃ ni ∃ npi (t1 = D ∧ t2 = N ∧ t3 = I ∧ t4 = X ∧ t5 = ni ∧ t6 = npi ∧ t7 = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t8 = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩) $ by ex_elim [l13, l12]
