l17: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_spz_ctors t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 ⟩ , ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_spz_ctors y z u v w a ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a (x = ⟨ ∅ , ra_spz_ctors y z u v w a ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
