l33: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_spz_ctors t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 ⟩ , ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f ∃ g ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ d (x = ⟨ scons (ra_sinst z ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ i j a b) (scons (ra_ind_nested z v) (scons (ra_rst z v b c) (scons (ra_afree c) (scons (ra_pinst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ w c f) (scons (ra_spz y u ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f g) (scons (ra_spz_ctors y u z w i j k d) ∅)))))) , ra_spz_ctors y u z w i j ⟨ kc_ccons , scons a (scons k ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_ccons , scons g (scons d ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f ∃ g ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ d (x = ⟨ scons (ra_sinst z ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ i j a b) (scons (ra_ind_nested z v) (scons (ra_rst z v b c) (scons (ra_afree c) (scons (ra_pinst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ w c f) (scons (ra_spz y u ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ f g) (scons (ra_spz_ctors y u z w i j k d) ∅)))))) , ra_spz_ctors y u z w i j ⟨ kc_ccons , scons a (scons k ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_ccons , scons g (scons d ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
