lemma y1_o_spz_ctors (G: hyps) {D N I X ni npi NI K K1 K2 K3 K4 C C2: set} (pp t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8: set):
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_spz_ctors t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 ⟩ ∈ pr_spz_ctors $ > $ G ⇒ crn pp ⊆ lrel $ >
  $ G ⇒ ∃ D ∃ N ∃ I ∃ X ∃ ni ∃ npi (t1 = D ∧ t2 = N ∧ t3 = I ∧ t4 = X ∧ t5 = ni ∧ t6 = npi ∧ t7 = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ t8 = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩) ∨ ∃ D ∃ I ∃ N ∃ NI ∃ X ∃ K ∃ K1 ∃ K2 ∃ K3 ∃ K4 ∃ ni ∃ npi ∃ C ∃ C2 (t1 = D ∧ t2 = N ∧ t3 = I ∧ t4 = X ∧ t5 = ni ∧ t6 = npi ∧ t7 = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K (scons C ∅) ⟩ ∧ t8 = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K4 (scons C2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_sinst I ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ni npi K K1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_nested I NI ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rst I NI K1 K2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_afree K2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pinst ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ X K2 K3 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_spz D N ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ K3 K4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_spz_ctors D N I X ni npi C C2 ∈ lrel) $
