l1: $ G , ⟨ pp , ra_spz_ctors t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 ⟩ ∈ cl_spz_ctors_cons ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_spz_ctors t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 ⟩ ∈ cl_spz_ctors_cons $ by ax
