lemma y1_d_ihty_pi (G: hyps) {D np n_v mo fld y_v j_v A B IH: set} (pp t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9: set):
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_ihty t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 ⟩ ∈ cl_ihty_pi $ > $ G ⇒ crn pp ⊆ lrel $ >
  $ G ⇒ ∃ D ∃ np ∃ n_v ∃ mo ∃ fld ∃ y_v ∃ j_v ∃ A ∃ B ∃ IH (t1 = D ∧ t2 = np ∧ t3 = n_v ∧ t4 = mo ∧ t5 = fld ∧ t6 = y_v ∧ t7 = j_v ∧ t8 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ ∧ t9 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons IH ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_ihty D np n_v mo fld ⟨ kc_s , scons y_v ∅ ⟩ j_v B IH ∈ lrel) $
----
l1: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_ihty t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 ⟩ , x ∊ cl_ihty_pi ⇒ x ∊ cl_ihty_pi $ by ax
l2: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_ihty t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 ⟩ , x ∊ cl_ihty_pi ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f ∃ g (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihty y z u v w ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ b f g) ∅ , ra_ihty y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_pi , scons c (scons f ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons c (scons g ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_ihty t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 ⟩ , x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihty y z u v w ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ b f g) ∅ , ra_ihty y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_pi , scons c (scons f ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons c (scons g ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ pp , ra_ihty t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 ⟩ $ by ax
l4: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_ihty t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 ⟩ , x = ⟨ scons (ra_ihty y z u v w ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ b f g) ∅ , ra_ihty y z u v w a b ⟨ kc_pi , scons c (scons f ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_pi , scons c (scons g ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_ihty t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 ⟩ = x $ by eq_sym [l3]
