l27: $ G ⇒ scons t3 (scons t4 (scons t5 (scons t6 (scons t7 (scons t8 (scons t9 (scons t10 (scons t11 ∅)))))))) ∈ fseq y1_vv $ by y1_fs [l26, l25]
