l33: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_rwalk t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 ⟩ , ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f ∃ g ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ d (x = ⟨ scons (ra_add b z c) (scons (ra_closed c i) (scons (ra_add v u f) (scons (ra_lift f b i j) (scons (ra_rwalk y z u v w a ⟨ kc_s , scons b ∅ ⟩ g k d) ∅)))) , ra_rwalk y z u v w a b g ⟨ kc_pi , scons i (scons k ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons j (scons d ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c ∃ f ∃ g ∃ i ∃ j ∃ k ∃ d (x = ⟨ scons (ra_add b z c) (scons (ra_closed c i) (scons (ra_add v u f) (scons (ra_lift f b i j) (scons (ra_rwalk y z u v w a ⟨ kc_s , scons b ∅ ⟩ g k d) ∅)))) , ra_rwalk y z u v w a b g ⟨ kc_pi , scons i (scons k ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_lam , scons j (scons d ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
