lemma y1_d_rwalk_res (G: hyps) {D np n_v m_v v_v d_v Acc K: set} (pp t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10: set):
  $ G ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_rwalk t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 ⟩ ∈ cl_rwalk_res $ > $ G ⇒ crn pp ⊆ lrel $ >
  $ G ⇒ ∃ D ∃ np ∃ n_v ∃ m_v ∃ v_v ∃ d_v ∃ Acc ∃ K (t1 = D ∧ t2 = np ∧ t3 = n_v ∧ t4 = m_v ∧ t5 = v_v ∧ t6 = d_v ∧ t7 = d_v ∧ t8 = Acc ∧ t9 = K ∧ t10 = Acc ∧ ra_npis K ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∈ lrel) $
----
l1: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_rwalk t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 ⟩ , x ∊ cl_rwalk_res ⇒ x ∊ cl_rwalk_res $ by ax
l2: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_rwalk t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 ⟩ , x ∊ cl_rwalk_res ⇒ ∃ y ∃ z ∃ u ∃ v ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c (x = ⟨ scons (ra_npis c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) ∅ , ra_rwalk y z u v w a a b c b ⟩) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_rwalk t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 ⟩ , x = ⟨ scons (ra_npis c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) ∅ , ra_rwalk y z u v w a a b c b ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ pp , ra_rwalk t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 ⟩ $ by ax
