l5: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_rwalk t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 ⟩ , x = ⟨ scons (ra_npis c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) ∅ , ra_rwalk y z u v w a a b c b ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ scons (ra_npis c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) ∅ , ra_rwalk y z u v w a a b c b ⟩ $ by ax
l6: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_rwalk t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 ⟩ , x = ⟨ scons (ra_npis c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) ∅ , ra_rwalk y z u v w a a b c b ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ pp , ra_rwalk t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 ⟩ = ⟨ scons (ra_npis c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) ∅ , ra_rwalk y z u v w a a b c b ⟩ $ by eq_trans [l4, l5]
l7: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_rwalk t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 ⟩ , x = ⟨ scons (ra_npis c ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) ∅ , ra_rwalk y z u v w a a b c b ⟩ ⇒ crn pp ⊆ lrel $ by weaken [#2]
