l3: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_rec_rhs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ⟩ , x = ⟨ scons (ra_ind_data y z u v) (scons (ra_clen u c) (scons (ra_ntys v f g) (scons (ra_motives y c w ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v e) (scons (ra_minors y c f ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ v h) (scons (ra_nth_ty v a l t) (scons (ra_nth_ctor t b m) (scons (ra_minor_idx v a b i) (scons (ra_npis m j) (scons (ra_add j g k) (scons (ra_add d ⟨ kc_s , scons i ∅ ⟩ k) (scons (ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons d ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ j n) (scons (ra_rwalk y c f g w j ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ n m o) (scons (ra_lams h o p) (scons (ra_lams e p q) (scons (ra_lams u q r) ∅))))))))))))))) , ra_rec_rhs y w a b r ⟩ ⇒ x = ⟨ pp , ra_rec_rhs t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ⟩ $ by ax
