l11: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_field_ty t1 t2 t3 t4 ⟩ , ∃ k ∃ d (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ind_data y z u v) (scons (ra_nth_ty v w g d) (scons (ra_nth_ctor d ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ i) (scons (ra_clen u b) (scons (ra_ntys v c f) (scons (ra_sinst y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ c b i j) (scons (ra_nth_pi j a k) ∅)))))) , ra_field_ty y w a k ⟩) ⇒ ∃ k ∃ d (x = ⟨ scons (ra_ind_data y z u v) (scons (ra_nth_ty v w g d) (scons (ra_nth_ctor d ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ i) (scons (ra_clen u b) (scons (ra_ntys v c f) (scons (ra_sinst y ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ c b i j) (scons (ra_nth_pi j a k) ∅)))))) , ra_field_ty y w a k ⟩) $ by ax
