l13: $ G , x = ⟨ pp , ra_qinst t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 ⟩ , ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b (x = ⟨ scons (ra_inst a u ⟨ kc_proj , scons y (scons b (scons z ∅)) ⟩ v) (scons (ra_qinst y z a ⟨ kc_s , scons b ∅ ⟩ v w) ∅) , ra_qinst y z ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ b u w ⟩) ⇒ ∃ w ∃ a ∃ b (x = ⟨ scons (ra_inst a u ⟨ kc_proj , scons y (scons b (scons z ∅)) ⟩ v) (scons (ra_qinst y z a ⟨ kc_s , scons b ∅ ⟩ v w) ∅) , ra_qinst y z ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ b u w ⟩) $ by ax
