l33: $ GG , ∃ d (q1 = a ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons b ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_add a b d ∈ lrel) ⇒ q3 = w3 $ by ex_elim [l32, l31]
