l35: $ GG , ∃ b ∃ d (q1 = a ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons b ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_add a b d ∈ lrel) ⇒ q3 = w3 $ by ex_elim [l34, l33]
