l38: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_clen_c q1 q2 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_clen_c_cons , w = ⟨ scons (ra_clen_c C n) ∅ , ra_clen_c ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K (scons C ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∀ K ∀ C ∀ n (q1 = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K (scons C ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_clen_c C n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c C n ∈ y2_P_clen_c lrel → ph) $ by weaken [#3]
