l29: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_cnth q1 q2 q3 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_cnth_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_cnth ⟨ kc_cons , scons A (scons G ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ A ⟩ ⇒ ∀ A ∀ G (q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons A (scons G ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ q3 = A → ph) $ by weaken [#3]
l30: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_cnth q1 q2 q3 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_cnth_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_cnth ⟨ kc_cons , scons A (scons G ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ A ⟩ ⇒ ∀ G (q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons A (scons G ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ q3 = A → ph) $ by all_elim [l29]
l31: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_cnth q1 q2 q3 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_cnth_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_cnth ⟨ kc_cons , scons A (scons G ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ A ⟩ ⇒ q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons A (scons G ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ q3 = A → ph $ by all_elim [l30]
l32: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_cnth q1 q2 q3 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_cnth_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_cnth ⟨ kc_cons , scons A (scons G ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ A ⟩ ⇒ ph $ by imp_elim [l31, l28]
