l32: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = d ∧ ra_cnth b e d ∈ lrel ⇒ ⊥ $ by y2_ne [l21, l25, l29, l31]
l33: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = d ∧ ra_cnth b e d ∈ lrel ⇒ q3 = w3 $ by bot_elim [l32]
l34: $ GG , ∃ e (q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = d ∧ ra_cnth b e d ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ e (q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = d ∧ ra_cnth b e d ∈ lrel) $ by ax
l35: $ GG , ∃ e (q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = d ∧ ra_cnth b e d ∈ lrel) ⇒ q3 = w3 $ by ex_elim [l34, l33]
l36: $ GG , ∃ b ∃ e (q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = d ∧ ra_cnth b e d ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ b ∃ e (q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = d ∧ ra_cnth b e d ∈ lrel) $ by ax
