l39: $ GG , ∃ d ∃ b ∃ e (q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = d ∧ ra_cnth b e d ∈ lrel) ⇒ q3 = w3 $ by ex_elim [l38, l37]
