l16: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_cnth q1 q2 q3 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_cnth_s , w = ⟨ scons (ra_cnth G n B) ∅ , ra_cnth ⟨ kc_cons , scons A (scons G ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ B ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ kr_cnth , scons q1 (scons q2 (scons q3 ∅)) ⟩ = ⟨ kr_cnth , scons ⟨ kc_cons , scons A (scons G ∅) ⟩ (scons ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ (scons B ∅)) ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [l14]
