l5: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ q2 = a ∧ w3 = a ⇒ q2 = u_G ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons u_A (scons u_G2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_capp u_P u_G u_G2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp u_P u_G u_G2 ∈ y2_P_capp lrel $ by and_elim_r [l3]
