l24: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = a ∧ w3 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons b (scons e ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_capp d a e ∈ lrel ⇒ q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons u_A (scons u_P ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = u_G ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons u_A (scons u_G2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_capp u_P u_G u_G2 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_capp u_P u_G u_G2 ∈ y2_P_capp lrel $ by weaken [#1]
