l36: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_npis q1 q2 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_npis_pi , w = ⟨ scons (ra_npis B n) ∅ , ra_npis ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_npis B n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis B n ∈ y2_P_npis lrel $ by and_intro [l25, l35]
l37: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_npis q1 q2 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_npis_pi , w = ⟨ scons (ra_npis B n) ∅ , ra_npis ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ q1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_npis B n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis B n ∈ y2_P_npis lrel $ by and_intro [l24, l36]
l38: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_npis q1 q2 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_npis_pi , w = ⟨ scons (ra_npis B n) ∅ , ra_npis ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∀ A ∀ B ∀ n (q1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_npis B n ∈ lrel ∧ ra_npis B n ∈ y2_P_npis lrel → ph) $ by weaken [#3]
