l23: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ ra_isort d e a ∈ lrel ⇒ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [l22]
l24: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ ra_isort d e a ∈ lrel ⇒ w3 = a ∧ ra_isort d e a ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [l22]
l25: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ ra_isort d e a ∈ lrel ⇒ w3 = a $ by and_elim_l [l24]
l26: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ ra_isort d e a ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_isort d e a ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [l24]
l27: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ ra_isort d e a ∈ lrel ⇒ kc_srt ∈ kc_pi $ by y2_lt_srt_pi
l28: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ ra_isort d e a ∈ lrel ⇒ kc_pi ∈ ω $ by v1_kc_pi
