l30: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ ra_isort d e a ∈ lrel ⇒ ⊥ $ by y2_ne [l17, l21, l27, l29]
l31: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ ra_isort d e a ∈ lrel ⇒ q2 = w2 ∧ q3 = w3 $ by bot_elim [l30]
l32: $ GG , ∃ a (q1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ ra_isort d e a ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ a (q1 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ ra_isort d e a ∈ lrel) $ by ax
