l22: $ GG , ∃ a (q1 = ⟨ kc_srt , scons a ∅ ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a) ⇒ q2 = w2 ∧ q3 = w3 $ by ex_elim [l21, l20]
