l36: $ GG , ∃ d ∃ a ∃ e (q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = e ∧ ra_ndecl d a e ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ d ∃ a ∃ e (q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = e ∧ ra_ndecl d a e ∈ lrel) $ by ax
l37: $ GG , ∃ d ∃ a ∃ e (q1 = ⟨ kc_cons , scons b (scons d ∅) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons a ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = e ∧ ra_ndecl d a e ∈ lrel) ⇒ q3 = w3 $ by ex_elim [l36, l35]
