l38: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_nth_ty q1 q2 q3 q4 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_nth_ty_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_nth_ty ⟨ kc_tcons , scons F (scons C (scons T ∅)) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ F C ⟩ ⇒ ph $ by imp_elim [l37, l33]
l39: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_nth_ty q1 q2 q3 q4 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_nth_ty_z , ∃ T (w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_nth_ty ⟨ kc_tcons , scons F (scons C (scons T ∅)) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ F C ⟩) ⇒ ∃ T (w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_nth_ty ⟨ kc_tcons , scons F (scons C (scons T ∅)) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ F C ⟩) $ by ax
