l21: $ GG , ∃ a ∃ b ∃ d (q1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons a (scons b (scons d ∅)) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ w4 = b) ⇒ ∃ a ∃ b ∃ d (q1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons a (scons b (scons d ∅)) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ w4 = b) $ by ax
