l26: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons e (scons f (scons d ∅)) ⟩ ∧ q2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons g ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = a ∧ w4 = b ∧ ra_nth_ty d g a b ∈ lrel ⇒ q2 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ q3 = u_F ∧ q4 = u_C $ by and_elim_r [l24]
