l4: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_nth_ctor q1 q2 q3 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_nth_ctor_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_nth_ctor ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K (scons C ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ K ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_nth_ctor ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K (scons C ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ K ⟩ $ by ax
l5: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_nth_ctor q1 q2 q3 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_nth_ctor_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_nth_ctor ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K (scons C ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ K ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ o , ra_nth_ctor q1 q2 q3 ⟩ = w $ by eq_sym [l3]
l6: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_nth_ctor q1 q2 q3 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_nth_ctor_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_nth_ctor ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K (scons C ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ K ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ o , ra_nth_ctor q1 q2 q3 ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ , ra_nth_ctor ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K (scons C ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ K ⟩ $ by eq_trans [l5, l4]
l7: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_nth_ctor q1 q2 q3 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_nth_ctor_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_nth_ctor ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K (scons C ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ K ⟩ ⇒ isset o $ by isset_var
