l9: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_nth_ctor q1 q2 q3 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_nth_ctor_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_nth_ctor ⟨ kc_ccons , scons K (scons C ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ K ⟩ ⇒ isset ∅ $ by ax_empty
