l44: $ GG , ∃ b ∃ d ∃ e ∃ f ∃ g ∃ h (q1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons a (scons b (scons d ∅)) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = h ∧ ra_ntys d e f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c b g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add f g h ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ b ∃ d ∃ e ∃ f ∃ g ∃ h (q1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons a (scons b (scons d ∅)) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = h ∧ ra_ntys d e f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c b g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add f g h ∈ lrel) $ by ax
l45: $ GG , ∃ b ∃ d ∃ e ∃ f ∃ g ∃ h (q1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons a (scons b (scons d ∅)) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = h ∧ ra_ntys d e f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c b g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add f g h ∈ lrel) ⇒ q2 = w2 ∧ q3 = w3 $ by ex_elim [l44, l43]
l46: $ GG , ∃ a ∃ b ∃ d ∃ e ∃ f ∃ g ∃ h (q1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons a (scons b (scons d ∅)) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = h ∧ ra_ntys d e f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c b g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add f g h ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ a ∃ b ∃ d ∃ e ∃ f ∃ g ∃ h (q1 = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons a (scons b (scons d ∅)) ⟩ ∧ w2 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w3 = h ∧ ra_ntys d e f ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c b g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add f g h ∈ lrel) $ by ax
