l41: $ GG , q1 = ⟨ kc_ind_mkn , scons a (scons b (scons d (scons e ∅))) ⟩ ∧ w2 = a ∧ w3 = b ∧ w4 = d ⇒ q2 = w2 ∧ q3 = w3 ∧ q4 = w4 $ by bot_elim [l40]
