--| The atoms of `ind_arity` whose variants in `L` with the same inputs have the same outputs.
def y2_P_ind_arity (L: class) (.c .x1 .x2 .x3 .x4 .x6 .x7 .x8: set): class = $ {c | ∀ x1 ∀ x2 ∀ x3 ∀ x4 (c = ⟨ kr_ind_arity , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 (scons x4 ∅))) ⟩ → ∀ x6 ∀ x7 ∀ x8 (⟨ kr_ind_arity , scons x1 (scons x6 (scons x7 (scons x8 ∅))) ⟩ ∈ L → x2 = x6 ∧ x3 = x7 ∧ x4 = x8))} $

