l6: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_nfields q1 q2 q3 q4 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_nfields_i , w = ⟨ scons (ra_ind_data D b P T) (scons (ra_nth_ty T i F C) (scons (ra_nth_ctor C c K) (scons (ra_npis K nf) ∅))) , ra_nfields D i c nf ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ o , ra_nfields q1 q2 q3 q4 ⟩ = ⟨ scons (ra_ind_data D b P T) (scons (ra_nth_ty T i F C) (scons (ra_nth_ctor C c K) (scons (ra_npis K nf) ∅))) , ra_nfields D i c nf ⟩ $ by eq_trans [l5, l4]
