l23: $ GG , q1 = a ∧ q2 = b ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w4 = ⟨ kc_app , scons d (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons b ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_pargs a ⟨ kc_s , scons b ∅ ⟩ e d ∈ lrel ⇒ q1 = u_X $ by and_elim_l [l22]
