l4: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_pargs q1 q2 q3 q4 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_pargs_s , w = ⟨ scons (ra_pargs X ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ n e) ∅ , ra_pargs X d ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons d ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w = ⟨ scons (ra_pargs X ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ n e) ∅ , ra_pargs X d ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons d ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
l5: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_pargs q1 q2 q3 q4 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_pargs_s , w = ⟨ scons (ra_pargs X ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ n e) ∅ , ra_pargs X d ⟨ kc_s , scons n ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons d ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ o , ra_pargs q1 q2 q3 q4 ⟩ = w $ by eq_sym [l3]
