l52: $ GG , ∃ b ∃ e (q1 = a ∧ q2 = b ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w4 = ⟨ kc_app , scons d (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons b ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_pargs a ⟨ kc_s , scons b ∅ ⟩ e d ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ b ∃ e (q1 = a ∧ q2 = b ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_s , scons e ∅ ⟩ ∧ w4 = ⟨ kc_app , scons d (scons ⟨ kc_bvar , scons b ∅ ⟩ ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_pargs a ⟨ kc_s , scons b ∅ ⟩ e d ∈ lrel) $ by ax
