l11: $ GG , ⟨ o , c ⟩ ∈ lprog , crn o ⊆ horn lprog ∩ y2_P_pargs lrel , c = ra_pargs x1 x2 x3 x4 , ra_pargs x1 x2 x3 x6 ∈ lrel , ⟨ o , ra_pargs x1 x2 x3 x4 ⟩ ∈ cl_pargs_z ⇒ ra_pargs x1 x2 x3 x6 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [l8]
l12: $ GG , ⟨ o , c ⟩ ∈ lprog , crn o ⊆ horn lprog ∩ y2_P_pargs lrel , c = ra_pargs x1 x2 x3 x4 , ra_pargs x1 x2 x3 x6 ∈ lrel , ⟨ o , ra_pargs x1 x2 x3 x4 ⟩ ∈ cl_pargs_z ⇒ x4 = x6 $ by y2_pargs_d1 [l9, l10, l11]
