l33: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩ ⇒ q4 = Y $ by and_elim_l [l32]
l34: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩ ⇒ q5 = X $ by and_elim_r [l32]
l35: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩ ⇒ q4 = Y ∧ q5 = X $ by and_intro [l33, l34]
l36: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩ ⇒ q3 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ q4 = Y ∧ q5 = X $ by and_intro [l31, l35]
l37: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩ ⇒ q2 = X ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ q4 = Y ∧ q5 = X $ by and_intro [l29, l36]
l38: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩ ⇒ q1 = Y ∧ q2 = X ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ q4 = Y ∧ q5 = X $ by and_intro [l27, l37]
l39: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩ ⇒ ∀ Y ∀ X (q1 = Y ∧ q2 = X ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ q4 = Y ∧ q5 = X → ph) $ by weaken [#3]
l40: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩ ⇒ ∀ X (q1 = Y ∧ q2 = X ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ q4 = Y ∧ q5 = X → ph) $ by all_elim [l39]
l41: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩ ⇒ q1 = Y ∧ q2 = X ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ q4 = Y ∧ q5 = X → ph $ by all_elim [l40]
l42: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z , w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩ ⇒ ph $ by imp_elim [l41, l38]
l43: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z , ∃ X (w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩) ⇒ ∃ X (w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩) $ by ax
l44: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z , ∃ X (w = ⟨ ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ Y X ⟩) ⇒ ph $ by ex_elim [l43, l42]
l45: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_z ⇒ ph $ by ex_elim [l2, l44]
