l27: $ GG , w1 = a ∧ q2 = b ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_s , scons g ∅ ⟩ ∧ q4 = ⟨ kc_app , scons d (scons f ∅) ⟩ ∧ w5 = ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons f ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead a b g d e ∈ lrel ⇒ q1 = u_Y $ by and_elim_l [l26]
