l64: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_s , ∃ a ∃ k (w = ⟨ scons (ra_rehead Y X k e e2) ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e2 (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ph $ by ex_elim [l63, l62]
l65: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_s , ∃ e2 ∃ a ∃ k (w = ⟨ scons (ra_rehead Y X k e e2) ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e2 (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ e2 ∃ a ∃ k (w = ⟨ scons (ra_rehead Y X k e e2) ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e2 (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
l66: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_s , ∃ e2 ∃ a ∃ k (w = ⟨ scons (ra_rehead Y X k e e2) ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e2 (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ph $ by ex_elim [l65, l64]
l67: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_s , ∃ e ∃ e2 ∃ a ∃ k (w = ⟨ scons (ra_rehead Y X k e e2) ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e2 (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ e ∃ e2 ∃ a ∃ k (w = ⟨ scons (ra_rehead Y X k e e2) ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e2 (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
l68: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_s , ∃ e ∃ e2 ∃ a ∃ k (w = ⟨ scons (ra_rehead Y X k e e2) ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e2 (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ph $ by ex_elim [l67, l66]
l69: $ GG , w = ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ , w ∊ cl_rehead_s , ∃ X ∃ e ∃ e2 ∃ a ∃ k (w = ⟨ scons (ra_rehead Y X k e e2) ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e2 (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ X ∃ e ∃ e2 ∃ a ∃ k (w = ⟨ scons (ra_rehead Y X k e e2) ∅ , ra_rehead Y X ⟨ kc_s , scons k ∅ ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟨ kc_app , scons e2 (scons a ∅) ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
