lemma y2_rehead_d2 (GG: hyps) (o q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 w1 w5: set):
  $ GG ⇒ ⟨ o , ra_rehead q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 ⟩ ∈ cl_rehead_s $ > $ GG ⇒ crn o ⊆ horn lprog ∩ y2_P_rehead lrel $ > $ GG ⇒ ra_rehead w1 q2 q3 q4 w5 ∈ lrel $ > $ GG ⇒ q1 = w1 ∧ q5 = w5 $
----
l1: $ GG , q1 = a ∧ q2 = b ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_s , scons g ∅ ⟩ ∧ q4 = ⟨ kc_app , scons d (scons f ∅) ⟩ ∧ q5 = ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons f ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead a b g d e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rehead a b g d e ∈ y2_P_rehead lrel ⇒ q1 = a ∧ q2 = b ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_s , scons g ∅ ⟩ ∧ q4 = ⟨ kc_app , scons d (scons f ∅) ⟩ ∧ q5 = ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons f ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead a b g d e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rehead a b g d e ∈ y2_P_rehead lrel $ by ax
l2: $ GG , q1 = a ∧ q2 = b ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_s , scons g ∅ ⟩ ∧ q4 = ⟨ kc_app , scons d (scons f ∅) ⟩ ∧ q5 = ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons f ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead a b g d e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rehead a b g d e ∈ y2_P_rehead lrel ⇒ ra_rehead w1 q2 q3 q4 w5 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#3]
