l5: $ GG ⇒ ∀ g (q1 = a ∧ q2 = b ∧ q3 = ⟨ kc_s , scons g ∅ ⟩ ∧ q4 = ⟨ kc_app , scons d (scons f ∅) ⟩ ∧ q5 = ⟨ kc_app , scons e (scons f ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead a b g d e ∈ lrel ∧ ra_rehead a b g d e ∈ y2_P_rehead lrel → q1 = w1 ∧ q5 = w5) $ by all_intro [l4]
