l16: $ GG , w1 = a ∧ q2 = a ∧ w3 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ ¬ ∃ x ∃ y (q1 = ⟨ kc_app , scons x (scons y ∅) ⟩) $ by weaken [#3]
